# --- added during the rebuild -------------------------------------------
# Raw model source. 119 MB of uncompressed GLBs that nothing loads — the site
# serves the compressed copies in public/models (11 MB total). Git keeps
# blobs forever, so committing these once bloats the repo permanently even if
# they are deleted later. Keep them on disk, back them up outside git.
/2000_ferrari_f2000.glb
/2008_williams_fw30.glb
/2018_ferrari_sf71h.glb
/f1_2022_generic.glb
/f1_steering_wheel_w11.glb

